SUMMARY:Rankings & Accreditations
DESCRIPTION:International Rankings Webometrics Ranking Al-Qadisiyah University holds advanced positions in the Webometrics World Universities Ranking, which measures the digital presence and impact of universities.\nTimes Higher Education Ranking The university is working to achieve an advanced position in THE ranking, which evaluates universities based on teaching, research, citations, and internationalization.\nQS World Rankings The university is working to improve its indicators to enter the QS World University Rankings.\nAcademic Accreditations National Accreditation Iraqi Ministry of Higher Education and Scientific Research accreditation Scientific Supervision and Evaluation Authority accreditation International Accreditations The university is seeking international accreditations from:\nABET for engineering programs AACSB for business programs WHO for medical and health programs Quality Indicators Indicator Description Student-Faculty Ratio 1:20 Faculty with PhD 85% Annual Published Research 1000+ Patents 50+ Academic Achievements Several academic programs have received local accreditation Active participation in international scientific conferences Academic cooperation with prestigious global universities Graduating researchers and specialists working in global institutions 
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
