SUMMARY:Strategic Plan
DESCRIPTION:Strategic Plan 2024-2029 Strategic Vision To position Al-Qadisiyah University as a leading institution regionally and internationally in education, scientific research, and community service.\nStrategic Objectives Enhance Education Quality - Improve academic programs according to international standards Strengthen Research - Increase research output published in global databases Community Service - Provide programs and services that meet local community needs Digital Transformation - Develop technical infrastructure and e-services Institutional Excellence - Improve administrative performance and governance Annual Reports Year Report 2024-2025 Download PDF 2023-2024 Download PDF 2022-2023 Download PDF Performance Indicators Indicator Target Achievement Graduate Employment Rate 80% 75% Scopus Publications 600 520 Student Satisfaction 85% 82% Full Strategic Plan Download Complete Strategic Plan (PDF)\n
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
